<title>ITALY: S&amp;P assigns Pop Milano long-term A rating.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns Pop Milano long-term A rating.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit rating agency Standard and Poor's has assigned Banca Popolare di Milano a long-term credit rating of A, a short-term A-1 rating and assessed it as having a &quot;stable outlook&quot;, the Italian bank said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The S&amp;P ratings rewarded the quality of Banca Popolare di Milano's management and the important steps it had made in the last three years in controlling risk and income, the bank said in the statement.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
